<title>BRAZIL: Brazil bolsas change trading hours as of Monday.</title>
<headline>Brazil bolsas change trading hours as of Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian stock exchanges said they will open and close half hour earlier as of Monday.</p>
<p>The bolsas will open at 1000 local/1300 GMT and close at 1700/2000 GMT, with one hour break between 1330/1630 GMT and 1430/1730 GMT, the exchanges said.</p>
<p>Trading will remain non-stop electronically, they added.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
